  - m_Id: 3311736569890
    m_Localized: SHE STUDIED THE STABILITY OF ROCKY PASSES AND LEARNED TO READ TERRAIN BEFORE STARTING WORK. COMBINES SURVEYING PRECISION WITH ENGINEERING KNOWLEDGE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569891
    m_Localized: WHITE PASSAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569892
    m_Localized: PARTICIPATES FOR THE CARAVANS' COMMUNITY, WHICH WANTS TO FREE SUPPLY DELIVERY FROM A SINGLE PROVIDER.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569893
    m_Localized: JOINS TO SUPPORT THE NETWORK OF SMALL STATIONS THREATENED BY CLOSURE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569894
    m_Localized: PARTICIPATES SO THAT KNOWLEDGE OF ROUTES REMAINS ACCESSIBLE EVEN TO SMALLER CITIES.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569895
    m_Localized: HERO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569896
    m_Localized: HEROES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569897
    m_Localized: HEROES ARE SELECTED FROM A SHARED POOL WITHOUT DUPLICATES.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569898
    m_Localized: NONE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569899
    m_Localized: BUILDING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569900
    m_Localized: 'BUILD.

      RUN AWAY.

      ADAPT.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569901
    m_Localized: She studied the stability of rocky passes and learned to read terrain before starting work. Combines surveying precision with engineering knowledge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569902
    m_Localized: White Pass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569903
    m_Localized: Participates for the caravans' community, which wants to free supply delivery from a single provider.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569904
    m_Localized: Joins to support the network of small stations threatened by closure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569905
    m_Localized: Participates so that knowledge of routes remains accessible even to smaller cities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569906
    m_Localized: Hero
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569907
    m_Localized: Heroes are selected from a shared pool without duplicates.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569908
    m_Localized: LIGHTNING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569909
    m_Localized: A LIGHTNING-FAST SCOUT SEARCHING FOR WEAK DEFENSE POINTS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569910
    m_Localized: Lightning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569911
    m_Localized: A lightning-fast scout searching for weak defense points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569912
    m_Localized: "GOAL: REACH THE FINISH   \u2022   TIME {0:F1} S   \u2022   FOG {1:F1} S"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569913
    m_Localized: "GOAL: REACH THE FINISH   \u2022   TIME {0:F1} s   \u2022   FOG {1:F1} s"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569914
    m_Localized: WANTS TO MAINTAIN ACCESS TO THE PATH CONNECTING SEVERAL DISTANT SETTLEMENTS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569915
    m_Localized: WANTS TO ACQUIRE RESOURCES FOR AN OPEN WORKSHOP TEACHING SAFE TOWER OPERATION.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569916
    m_Localized: CHILL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569917
    m_Localized: CHILL {0:F1}S
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569918
    m_Localized: CHILL {0:F1}s
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569919
    m_Localized: DARKNESS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569920
    m_Localized: SHADOWY PORT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569921
    m_Localized: 'HEAVY DAMAGE. DEVELOPMENT: QUAKE OR BOULDER.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569922
    m_Localized: TEMPORARILY STOPS THE TOWER'S SHOT.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569923
    m_Localized: THE FOG'S FRONT MOVES ALONG THE PATH. ITS ARRIVAL AT THE TARGET DOES NOT END THE ATTACK.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569924
    m_Localized: Wants to maintain access to the path connecting several distant settlements.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569925
    m_Localized: Wants to acquire resources for an open workshop teaching safe tower operation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569926
    m_Localized: Darkness
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569927
    m_Localized: Shadow Harbor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569928
    m_Localized: 'Heavy damage. Development: Quake or Boulder.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569929
    m_Localized: Temporarily stops the tower's shot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569930
    m_Localized: The fog's front moves along the path. Its arrival at the target does not end the attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569931
    m_Localized: FURTHER DEVELOPMENT LEADS TO A SHARED T3 UPGRADE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569932
    m_Localized: PREVIOUSLY PROTECTED MOUNTAIN CONVOYS AND ROADS TO SUPPLY DEPOTS. THE ICE SHIELD IS A SIGN OF HIS WAY OF PROTECTING THE GROUP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569933
    m_Localized: WHY PARTICIPATES IN THE TRIALS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569934
    m_Localized: 'TO FINISH: {0} M'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569935
    m_Localized: THE FINAL GAME COMBINES DEFENSE, EVASION, AND ADAPTATION TO THE OPPONENT.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569936
    m_Localized: DODGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569937
    m_Localized: GREW UP AMONG TELEGRAPH WORKSHOPS AND HELPED SHIELD REPAIR CREWS WORKING ON ENERGY CONDUCTORS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569938
    m_Localized: GREW UP AMONG CREWS PROTECTING CONVOYS FROM REVEALING THEIR ROUTES. USES HIS MASKING SKILLS TODAY TO DISRUPT DETECTION.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569939
    m_Localized: GREW UP WITH HER SISTERS IN THE SOUTHERN VALLEY, THEN TRAINED AT THE WHITE CAVERN. USES ICY ABILITIES TO PROTECT AND RESTORE FUNCTIONALITY.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569940
    m_Localized: DELIVERED URGENT MESSAGES BETWEEN RELAY STATIONS. HIS SPEED AND DEVICE INTUITION PROVED USEFUL LATER IN LABYRINTHS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569941
    m_Localized: REACH THE GOLDEN PORTAL WHILE DODGING TOWER FIRE AND STAYING AHEAD OF THE FOG. CAN YOU READ THE THREATS AND REACT IN TIME?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569942
    m_Localized: AVAILABLE IN THE 3D TRIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569943
    m_Localized: AVAILABLE / PRE-POC
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569944
    m_Localized: AVAILABLE IN TRIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569945
    m_Localized: JOINS ESCORT TEAMS BECAUSE HE KNOWS THE COST OF LOSING A SAFE PATH.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569946
    m_Localized: DRAFT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569947
    m_Localized: THE TEAM DEVELOPS ITS ELEMENTS TOGETHER AND CHOOSES UPGRADE PATHS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569948
    m_Localized: TEAMS BUILD DEFENSES AND ATTEMPT TO PASS THROUGH THE OPPONENT'S LABYRINTH.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569949
    m_Localized: TEAMS INVEST AND SET UP TOWERS ON THEIR MAPS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569950
    m_Localized: TREE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569951
    m_Localized: TECHNOLOGY TREE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569952
    m_Localized: TWO TEAMS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569953
    m_Localized: TWO TEAMS OF FIVE PLAYERS TAKE TURNS ATTACKING THE OPPONENT'S DEFENSE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569954
    m_Localized: Further development leads to a shared T3 upgrade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569955
    m_Localized: Previously protected mountain convoys and roads to supply depots. The ice shield is a sign of his way of protecting the group.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569956
    m_Localized: 'To finish: {0} m'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569957
    m_Localized: The final game combines defense, evasion, and adaptation to the opponent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569958
    m_Localized: Grew up among telegraph workshops and helped shield repair crews working on energy conductors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569959
    m_Localized: Grew up among crews protecting convoys from revealing their routes. Uses his masking skills today to disrupt detection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569960
    m_Localized: Grew up with her sisters in the southern valley, then trained at the White Cavern. Uses icy abilities to protect and restore functionality.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569961
    m_Localized: Delivered urgent messages between relay stations. His speed and device intuition proved useful later in labyrinths.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569962
    m_Localized: Reach the golden portal while dodging tower fire and staying ahead of the fog. Can you read the threats and react in time?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569963
    m_Localized: Joins escort teams because he knows the cost of losing a safe path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569964
    m_Localized: The team develops its elements together and chooses upgrade paths.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569965
    m_Localized: Teams build defenses and attempt to pass through the opponent's labyrinth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569966
    m_Localized: Teams invest and set up towers on their maps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569967
    m_Localized: Two teams of five players take turns attacking the opponent's defense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569968
    m_Localized: VISION-LIMITING EFFECTS LAST 20% LESS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569969
    m_Localized: EFFECTS CHANGE HOW HEROES PASS THROUGH THE DEFENSE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569970
    m_Localized: AN ENERGETIC LEADER WHO SYNCHRONIZES THE MOVEMENT OF THE ENTIRE TEAM.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569971
    m_Localized: RIFTORYN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569972
    m_Localized: Vision-limiting effects last 20% less.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569973
    m_Localized: Effects change how heroes pass through the defense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569974
    m_Localized: An energetic leader who synchronizes the movement of the entire team.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569975
    m_Localized: READY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569976
    m_Localized: READY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569977
    m_Localized: "PLAYERS INVEST IN ELEMENTAL TREES INDEPENDENTLY OF THEIR HERO\u2019S ELEMENT."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569978
    m_Localized: PLAY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569979
    m_Localized: PLAY ALONE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569980
    m_Localized: "Players invest in elemental trees independently of their hero\u2019s element."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569981
    m_Localized: ENDURANCE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736569982
    m_Localized: HISTORY
    m_Metadata:
