  - m_Id: 3311736570034
    m_Localized: YEARS OF REBUILDING DESTROYED FIELDS TAUGHT HER THAT THE STRONGEST DEFENDER IS AT THE BACK, ONLY WHEN OTHERS ARE SAFE. COMBINES RESILIENCE WITH A CONCERN FOR THE TEAM.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570035
    m_Localized: AURELIAN LIGHTHOUSE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570036
    m_Localized: A BEACON KEEPER WHO HELPS THE TEAM SPOT THREATS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570037
    m_Localized: HEALING AND SHIELD REPAIR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570038
    m_Localized: HEALS NEARBY ALLIES AND MOBS FOR 5 S.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570039
    m_Localized: "A LINE MATCHING THE TOWER\u2019S COLOR WARNS OF AN INCOMING SHOT. TOWERS LEAD THEIR TARGETS; WALLS BLOCK PROJECTILES.\n\nFIRE \u2014 AREA DAMAGE AND BURN.\nICE \u2014 CHILL SLOWS MOVEMENT.\nLIGHTNING \u2014 ARCS TO A NEARBY ALLY.\nNATURE \u2014 POISON DEALS DAMAGE OVER TIME."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570040
    m_Localized: SPARK THE FOX
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570041
    m_Localized: THE FOX CATCHES THE PROJECTILE AND CREATES A FIRE ZONE; IN DEFENSE, IT SUPPORTS THE TOWER'S AREA PRESSURE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570042
    m_Localized: GUARDIAN OF THE PASS. SHE FREEZES TOWER MECHANISMS TO CLEAR A SAFE PATH FOR HER TEAM.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570043
    m_Localized: "ICE SHIELD WARRIOR \u2014 DIRECTION TO BE DESIGNED"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570044
    m_Localized: Years of rebuilding destroyed fields taught her that the strongest defender is at the back, only when others are safe. Combines resilience with a concern for the team.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570045
    m_Localized: Aurelian Lighthouse
