      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570048
    m_Localized: Heals nearby allies and mobs for 5 s.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570049
    m_Localized: "A line matching the tower\u2019s color warns of an incoming shot. Towers lead their targets; walls block projectiles.\n\nFIRE \u2014 area damage and burn.\nICE \u2014 chill slows movement.\nLIGHTNING \u2014 arcs to a nearby ally.\nNATURE \u2014 poison deals damage over time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570050
    m_Localized: The fox catches the projectile and creates a fire zone; in defense, it supports the tower's area pressure.
    m_Metadata:
