      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570183
    m_Localized: CONFIRM YOUR HERO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570184
    m_Localized: MEET THE HEROES, THREATS, AND RULES OF THE TRIALS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570185
    m_Localized: A GUIDE FOR CREWS RESTORING OLD ROADS, ERON EXPLORED THE VALLEY AND SOUGHT WAYS TO USE VINES TO CROSS DIFFICULT TERRAIN.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570186
    m_Localized: WORKED ON EMITTER CALIBRATION AND LEARNED TO IDENTIFY WEAK POINTS IN MECHANISMS. IN TRIALS, SHE USES THIS KNOWLEDGE FOR PRECISE SABOTAGE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570187
    m_Localized: WORKED ON REPAIRING TRANSMITTERS WHERE SECONDS OFTEN DECIDED WHETHER THE MESSAGE ARRIVED IN TIME. IN TRIALS, TEACHES ALLIES TO ACT IN UNISON.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570188
    m_Localized: "PRE-POC \xB7 OFFLINE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570189
    m_Localized: A PRECISE SPECIALIST WHO TARGETS SPECIFIC DEFENSE POINTS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570190
    m_Localized: PRECISION TOWER DAMAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570191
    m_Localized: CONCEPT PROTOTYPE. RULES, DESCRIPTIONS, ART, AND BALANCE ARE PENDING TESTS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570192
    m_Localized: HE OPERATED A MOBILE LIGHTHOUSE FOR TRAVELERS BETWEEN SETTLEMENTS; HIS WARMTH AND OPTIMISM HELP KEEP THE TEAM TOGETHER.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570193
    m_Localized: "BEFORE THE TRIAL \xB7 WHAT WE TEST"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570194
    m_Localized: "GO TO THE TRIAL \u2192"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570195
    m_Localized: LIGHTNING LEAP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570196
    m_Localized: FOR 4S, SLOWS NEARBY FLYING PROJECTILES BY 50%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570197
    m_Localized: FOR YEARS, SHE SAFEGUARDED PIECES AND TRANSPORT OF SPLOTYT, LEARNING TO CONTAIN THE FIRE BEFORE IT THREATENED OTHERS. IN TRIALS, SHE DEFENDS HER TEAM AND STRENGTHENS THE TOWERS.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570198
    m_Localized: DIMMED HEROES ARE UNAVAILABLE IN THIS TRIAL.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570199
    m_Localized: PREPARE THE HERO AND EXPLORE THE LABYRINTH BEFORE THE ACTUAL GAMEPLAY.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
