    m_Localized: Concept prototype. Rules, descriptions, art, and balance are pending tests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570226
    m_Localized: He operated a mobile lighthouse for travelers between settlements; his warmth and optimism help keep the team together.
