    m_Localized: For 4s, slows nearby flying projectiles by 50%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570229
    m_Localized: For years, she safeguarded pieces and transport of splotyt, learning to contain the fire before it threatened others. In Trials, she defends her team and strengthens the towers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
