    m_Localized: SEVEN ELEMENTS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570273
    m_Localized: EACH OF THE SEVEN ELEMENTS BEGINS WITH A BASIC TECHNOLOGY CORE.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570274
    m_Localized: SISTERS ELIRY AND LIORY; THEIR TEAM CHOICES DO NOT HAVE TO BE THE SAME.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570275
    m_Localized: SISTER OF NIVY AND ELIRY; A SIMILAR APPEARANCE DOES NOT GIVE ANY BONUS IN THE GAME.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570276
    m_Localized: SISTER OF NIVY AND LIORY; THEIR FAMILY BACKGROUND DOES NOT FORCE A SHARED COMPOSITION.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3311736570277
    m_Localized: "FIX ITSELF (PROPOSAL): FOUR OUTCOMES AT 25% EACH \u2014 50 SHIELD, +50% ATTACK SPEED FOR 5 S, +50% PROJECTILE SPEED FOR 5 S, OR AN UNLUCKY RESULT THAT STOPS THE TOWER FOR 3 S."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
